{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24193","headline":"西街渠中种莲叠石颇有幽致偶题小楼 · 白居易","name":"西街渠中种莲叠石颇有幽致偶题小楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱槛低墙上，清流小阁前。\n雇人栽菡萏，买石造潺湲。\n影落江心月，声移谷口泉。\n闲看卷帘坐，醉听掩窗眠。\n路笑淘官水，家愁费料钱。\n是非君莫问，一对一翛然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}